At the regular election of Officers of the I. O. O. F. Lodge the
following officers were elected:


J. W. Hendrix, N. G.;


G. G. Bowman, V. G.;


J. W. Williams, Treas.;


A. J. Johnson, Sect.


On January 4th a banquet was
given by this order at the Red
River Hotel which was enjoyed
by the large number present.

